      "reason_headline": "Prudent Risk Assessment",
      "reason_detailed": "The agent demonstrates prudent risk management by initially executing a trade with a medium risk level, as recommended by StockAnalyze, and later adjusting its strategy to navigate potential industry downturns, as seen in Turn 12 and Turn 14."
    }
